    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "eb8455d3-b3de-3289-9b03-6f67c5ae63e6",
                "word": "caritative",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "82a4ab08-d200-3e9e-b5c9-694cfb9034bd",
                        "entry_id": "eb8455d3-b3de-3289-9b03-6f67c5ae63e6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "charitable"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1ff19627-b684-4504-942a-60710e267313",
                                "sense_id": "82a4ab08-d200-3e9e-b5c9-694cfb9034bd",
                                "text": "Since that time, both Catholicism and the Protestant denominations have seen an enormous outpouring of caritative agencies. Nuns and monks made teaching and care for the underprivileged a central part of their vocation; devout men and women have founded and devoted their lives to institutions as far removed as Mother Teresa's Missionaries of Charity and the Salvation Army."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "77fc00df-f185-4716-945b-cacc1aa79991",
                                "sense_id": "82a4ab08-d200-3e9e-b5c9-694cfb9034bd",
                                "text": "Initially guilds were founded founded for benevolent and caritative reasons; however, in time guilds developed into a major economic force within the towns in which they operated."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ba0df6aa-e258-4614-929c-2b72b8c760bb",
                                "sense_id": "82a4ab08-d200-3e9e-b5c9-694cfb9034bd",
                                "text": "The failure of the Fourth Lateran Council to take up Robert of Courson's reform agenda, despite Pope Innocent III's personal advocacy of religious charity and his patronage of the hospitaller movement, meant that the initiative to visit and correct caritative institutions would remain with individual bishops."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fd630e08-4f38-48b3-8ef6-ffd1aaee9dff",
                        "source_entry_id": "eb8455d3-b3de-3289-9b03-6f67c5ae63e6",
                        "source_sense_id": "82a4ab08-d200-3e9e-b5c9-694cfb9034bd",
                        "source_sense_description": "charitable",
                        "target_lang_word": "karitativ",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "karitativ",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f7c3010-6be5-30c9-a612-9e1cc0bc9b84",
                                        "entry_id": "35a688bf-7d2f-3c86-a699-e606be04f380",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "im Sinne der Karitas, auf der Karitas beruhend: so, dass es armen und kranken Menschen hilft"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "010e6c3c-2574-4d1f-835b-7f2a6badbd89",
                                                "sense_id": "8f7c3010-6be5-30c9-a612-9e1cc0bc9b84",
                                                "text": "Das gespendete Geld soll karitativen Zwecken zufließen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0527c216-f148-4168-9b32-670059fce7c9",
                                                "sense_id": "8f7c3010-6be5-30c9-a612-9e1cc0bc9b84",
                                                "text": "Das Internationale Rote Kreuz ist eine karitative Organisation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8f9c7e1-6836-4bf1-af0b-9990c4d394e5",
                                                "sense_id": "8f7c3010-6be5-30c9-a612-9e1cc0bc9b84",
                                                "text": "Er setzt sich in seiner Freizeit für karitative Projekte, z.B. der Tafel in Deutschland, ein."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8309f019-ea59-4127-a54c-0128a61a9074",
                                                "sense_id": "8f7c3010-6be5-30c9-a612-9e1cc0bc9b84",
                                                "text": "Es kann nicht sein, dass wir die sozialen Defizite dieses Staates durch karitative Organisationen auffangen lassen und die Bedürftigen damit zu Almosenempfängern machen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "026a93ee-510f-41e9-b0a8-932cb4d665c2",
                                                "sense_id": "8f7c3010-6be5-30c9-a612-9e1cc0bc9b84",
                                                "text": "Denn im Unterschied zur absoluten Armut, der man auf karitativem Wege, das heißt mit Lebensmitteltafeln, Kleiderkammern und Möbellagern begegnen kann, erfordert die Bekämpfung der relativen Armut, dass man den Reichtum antastet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ed63e69-562c-4631-8467-e54831f15aaf",
                                                "sense_id": "8f7c3010-6be5-30c9-a612-9e1cc0bc9b84",
                                                "text": "Neben geistlichem Beistand macht sie [die katholische Kirche] sich in diesen [afrikanischen] Ländern auch durch humanitäre und karitative Hilfe bei der Bevölkerung beliebt."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
